  "year": 2023,
  "arxivId": "2306.06070",
  "abstract": "Mind2Web is a new dataset and framework for building generalist agents that can complete complex tasks on any website. The agent learns to follow language instructions and interact with websites in a realistic and dynamic environment. With over 2,000 open-ended tasks collected from 137 websites spanning 31 domains, Mind2Web provides a diverse and challenging setting for training and evaluating generalist web agents.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "Imagine having a personal assistant that can navigate and interact with any website on your behalf. <strong>Generalist web agents</strong> aim to make this a reality by learning to follow language instructions and complete complex tasks on any website. The key challenge is to develop an agent that can generalize to <strong>unseen websites and domains</strong> without requiring extensive task-specific training data.",
