    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The Mind2Web framework consists of two main components: a <strong>small ranking model</strong> that filters and ranks website elements, and a <strong>large language model</strong> that predicts the next action based on the ranked elements. This two-stage process allows the agent to efficiently process complex web pages and make informed decisions about which actions to take.",
